OL,3,GNEWSARescued rollercoaster rider is
OL,4,Aready to go again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thrill-seeking father who was rescued
OL,7,Ffrom a rollercoaster has vowed to go
OL,8,Fback on it "as soon as it reopens"
OL,9,Fdespite having "a moment of anxiety"
OL,10,Fwhen it broke down.
OL,12,FSimon Davies was one of 27 people who
OL,13,Ffound themselves stranded on the
OL,14,FWipeout ride at Pleasurewood Hills, in
OL,15,FLowestoft, Suffolk, on Bank Holiday
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FThe 55-year-old, who lives near
OL,19,FNorwich, told the BBC he was the first
OL,20,Fto be removed from the ride and taken
OL,21,Fto safety by firefighters after being
OL,22,Fstuck for about an hour.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
