OL,3,GNEWSARescued rollercoaster rider is
OL,4,Aready to go again
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite his ordeal, Davies, who said he
OL,7,Fhad been on the ride at least 30 times
OL,8,Falready this year with his 14-year-old
OL,9,Fson, has not been put off returning to
OL,10,Fthe theme park.
